## Pick Your Register and Book It

**Clown nails** were never really one trend. They're two, cute and creepy, sitting under the same name, and the reader who leaves this list undecided has simply not been honest yet about which one they actually wanted from the start. That's fine. Halloween rewards commitment either way.

What matters now is walking into your appointment (or opening your own polish drawer) with a specific answer, not a vague mood board. Almond or square shape. White base or primary colour. Painted face or no face at all. Every idea above narrows into a decision you can hand straight to your nail tech, or execute yourself with tape and a dotting tool if that's the route you're taking. Halloween week fills up fast. Decide your register now, and go book it.
